ilable, encoding error, signing error — the failure is logged and the commit proceeds unsigned. This ensures that:\n    37\t\n    38\t- Users with hardware tokens that require a touch are not blocked during automated checkpoint saves.\n    39\t- Temporary `ssh-agent` unavailability does not cause data loss.\n    40\t- CI environments without signing keys continue to work.\n"}}
